---
import CtaBtn from '../website/cta-btn.astro';
import PricingDetails from '../website/pricing.astro';
---

  <!-- ============================================================
       PRICING
  ============================================================ -->
  <section class="sec sec-light pb-0">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="row mb-5">
        <div class="col-12 text-center">
          <span class="zin-eyebrow">Pricing</span>
          <h2 class="zin-h2">One price. One job. 14 days free.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-6">
          <div class="price-card">
            <div class="price-amount"><sup>£</sup>9.97</div>
            <p class="price-period">per month</p>
            <ul class="price-list">
              <li><span class="price-tick">✓</span> No tiers. No upsells.</li>
              <li><span class="price-tick">✓</span> 14-day free trial included</li>
              <li><span class="price-tick">✓</span> Cancel anytime — no questions asked</li>
              <li><span class="price-tick">✓</span> Full refund if cancelled in trial period</li>
            </ul>
            <CtaBtn />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row justify-content-center mt-5">
        <div class="col-lg-8 text-center">
          <p>If you are creating social media content, you're creating content worth far more than £9.97. Zin will provide inspiration, a starting point, an outline, all from real material you've already captured.</p>
          <p>With Zin, you never need to sit down to write without something genuine to work with.</p>
          <p>Zin has a 14 day free trial period.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <PricingDetails />